<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">King of the Lombards</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">King of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-the-lombards">Lombards</a> was the title of the rulers of the Lombard kingdom in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a>. After <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charlemagne">Charlemagne</a> conquered the kingdom in 774, he assumed the title himself, adding Italy to the Frankish realm. This step was an important stage in the formation of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/carolingian-empire">Carolingian Empire</a>.</p></div>
